  "parts": [
    {
      "id": "starting",
      "title": {
        "zh-CN": "从熟悉的一局开始",
        "en": "Begin with a familiar game"
      },
      "introduction": {
        "zh-CN": "玩一局小赛跑，看看桌边的人，想清楚这次请谁来玩，再写一句你想让这个游戏变成什么样。",
        "en": "Play a small race, watch the people at the table, decide who you will invite, and write one sentence about what you want the game to become."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "actions",
      "title": {
        "zh-CN": "改一条规则，请人试一次",
        "en": "Change one rule, then ask someone to try it"
      },
      "introduction": {
        "zh-CN": "把一个小点子写成别人照着就能做的动作，做一张只回答一个问题的小棋盘，再请一位朋友试一回合。读完这一部分，你就做完了第一次试玩。",
        "en": "Turn one small idea into an action someone else can follow, make a small board that answers one question, and ask a friend to try one turn. By the end of this part, you have run your first playtest."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "decisions",
      "title": {
        "zh-CN": "让每一次选择都值得想",
        "en": "Make each choice worth thinking about"
      },
      "introduction": {
        "zh-CN": "先把一个回合怎样结算看清，再看点数何时揭晓、重掷要不要花、位置和等待怎样改变决定。",
        "en": "First make sure a turn resolves the same way every time. Then look at when results are revealed, whether to spend a reroll, and how position and waiting change a decision."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "systems",
      "title": {
        "zh-CN": "看看规则怎样互相影响",
        "en": "See how rules affect each other"
      },
      "introduction": {
        "zh-CN": "加入补给、改变终点、把两个点子放在一起、试着合作，再多坐一位玩家；每个改法都放回棋盘走一遍。",
        "en": "Add a supply, change the ending, combine two ideas, try cooperation, and seat another player. Take every change back to the board and play it through."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "meaning",
      "title": {
        "zh-CN": "让人看懂，也愿意玩",
        "en": "Make it clear, and make people want to play"
      },
      "introduction": {
        "zh-CN": "主题、故事、组件和说明，决定玩家怎样理解同一套规则；也要让每个人都能动手参与。",
        "en": "Theme, story, components, and written rules shape how players understand the same rules. Everyone at the table also needs a way to take part."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "testing",
      "title": {
        "zh-CN": "再请人试，读懂记录",
        "en": "Test again and read what happened"
      },
      "introduction": {
        "zh-CN": "草稿更完整了，再请人试一次。把记录里的动作和原话分开看，从一句“太拖了”找到该改的那条规则。",
        "en": "With a fuller draft, ask someone to try it again. Separate actions from words in your notes, and trace “it dragged at the end” back to one rule you can change."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "revising",
      "title": {
        "zh-CN": "定稿，再交出去",
        "en": "Settle on a version and hand it over"
      },
      "introduction": {
        "zh-CN": "选定这一版要留下的规则，请没听过讲解的人照说明开始，最后把棋盘、规则和邀请装在一起交出去。",
        "en": "Choose the rules this version keeps, ask someone who has not heard you explain it to start from the written rules, and pack the board, rules, and invitation together."
      }
    }
  ],
